        "en": "Most pet owners warmly commend the Spruce Street team, highlighting stylists such as Ashley, Jackie, Daniella, and Hannah for their kindness and expertise. However, customer service drew sharp criticism from one reviewer over an adoption mix-up and another over a painful cut, bringing mixed overall sentiment."
