      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Grooming results receive broad satisfaction from cat and dog owners alike, with clients praising tidy coat styling, thorough bath specials, and stress-free nail grinding. While one owner reported nicks and poor detailing on a miniature Schnauzer, most reviewers report clean, proud-looking pets after every visit."
      }
    },
    {
