      "title": {
        "en": "Compassionate handling for nervous pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers emphasize how thoughtfully the team works with sensitive, frightened, and high-energy pets. Clients recount gentle medical baths for recovering fosters and patience with dogs who initially feared salon sounds, noting that many animals grow to love visiting staff behind the counter."
      }
    }
